{"id":"vachement","lemma":"vachement","pos":"adv","rank":3611,"glosses":["bloody, extremely"],"ipa":"/vaʃ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cf/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-vachement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-vachement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"C'est un livre vachement intéressant.","en":"This is an incredibly interesting book.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"book"},null,{"g":"interesting"}]},{"text":"C'est vachement gentil de ta part.","en":"That's awful sweet of you.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"kind, sweet"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"share"}]},{"text":"Ça pue vachement cette histoire.","en":"That's an awfully fishy story.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to stink, to smell","l":"puer"},null,{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"story"}]},{"text":"C'est vachement mieux que ce que tu as écrit avant.","en":"This is way better than what you wrote before.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"better"},{"g":"that / what"},null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to write","l":"écrire"},{"g":"before"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"what"]]}]}